 security:["Use Entra RBAC, PIM, managed identities, policy and separate subscriptions/projects to limit blast radius.","Control connections and deployments centrally; review who can create models, attach data and invoke tools.","Retain audit evidence for project changes, model releases, access grants and policy exceptions."],
 optimization:["Standardize reusable project templates, approved model deployments, evaluation sets and observability without centralizing all workload data.","Use quotas and budgets per project so experimentation cannot starve production.","Automate policy and release checks; manual governance should focus on exceptions and high-risk changes."],
 watch:["Control-plane governance does not automatically inspect every data-plane prompt, document or tool action.","A shared connection can become a cross-project data path if ownership and ACL boundaries are weak.","Changing central policy can affect many projects; stage and monitor governance updates."],
